WEBVTT

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.950
Darling's... an ESPer?!

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:07.460
What if Kasuga's an ESPer?!

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:17.300
Kasuga!

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:30.050
I've finally been caught... using the Power!

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:48.960
As I tried to kiss you, as if to avoid me...

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:56.770
...with your T-Shirt on,
you dove into the shining sea...

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:03.140
The white flower petals on your soaking skirt...

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:09.710
Spread open upon the surface of the blue water.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:18.730
Tell me why, when you winked...

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:26.670
...to tell me that you'd be mine...

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:31.340
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
You're unpredictable...

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.640
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:38.550
Tell Me, Tell Me,
...my Angel of the Summer...

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:41.150
'Tell me, lover, Tell me that you need me...

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:45.690
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
I know that you're in love...

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:49.090
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:55.600
Tell Me, Tell Me - but you're a mystery.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:12.560
Adios Kyosuke!
Paranormal powers caught on video!

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:18.640
"Koryo Construction, Inc."

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:21.890
You had me fooled real good!

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:24.950
W...Wait a second... I can explain...

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:27.480
No explanation necessary!

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:43.380
You actually believed this twerp? You're such an idiot.

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:47.430
So that's it, huh?
You guys were in this together!

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:51.740
So what if we were?

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:12.790
Cut!

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:23.450
Very good, everyone!

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:23.510
"Sukeban:" Girl Gang Hoodlums

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:28.440
"Sukeban Officer" will be a major hit
at the school video-contest!
"Sukeban:" Girl Gang Hoodlums

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:28.490
"Sukeban:" Girl Gang Hoodlums

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:30.900
Your performance was
especially awesome, Hikaru!

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:33.010
Thank you so much!

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:36.070
Ow... You hit me for real...

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:40.440
Oh, Darling... I'm sorry! Are you all right?

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:42.740
It might be a good idea to put on
a cold patch or something.

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:45.180
Yes... That might be a good idea.

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:47.440
Hikaru's so into her role, so...

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:51.730
Gosh! Madoka, you're into it too!

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:57.510
"Me, in a video?!"

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:58.200
"Yes!"
"Me, in a video?!"

00:03:58.200 --> 00:03:58.250
"Me, in a video?!"

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:01.160
"Director Komatsu insisted that I ask you, Madoka!"

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:02.930
"You're kidding!"

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:06.440
"Hey, Darling! Say something, won't you please?!"

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:08.690
"L... Let's do it, Ayukawa."

00:04:08.690 --> 00:04:10.700
"How often do you get to do
something like this?"

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:13.330
"Besides, the more the merrier!"

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:14.360
"No can do."

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:17.850
"C'mon! C'mon, Madoka!"
"No can do."

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:17.940
"No can do."

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:19.930
"No thank you!"

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:24.670
1... 2... 3...

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:25.070
Okay!
1... 2... 3...

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:25.150
1... 2... 3...

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:30.630
Though initially opposed,
Ayukawa's actually gotten into it now...

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:34.070
Hey, get going, man! We don't have much time left 'til the contest!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:36.560
Geez! Whatta blowhard!

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:40.030
Oh? Now, is it okay to talk to
the Director like that?

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:41.480
I could take you off the cast list!

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:42.250
Aye, sir!
I could take you off the cast list!

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:42.340
I could take you off the cast list!

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:45.480
Director Komatsu, are we really supposed to wear these?

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:47.700
Huh?

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:49.990
Yes... Yes... Get in them, like right now!

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:52.610
But, we're supposed to be "sukeban girls," right?

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:54.910
"Sukeban girls in leotards" sounds "cwazy" to me.

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:56.370
Uh-huh!

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:58.460
Do you understand what you're saying?!
Uh-huh!

00:04:58.460 --> 00:04:58.550
Uh-huh!

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:02.490
This is essentially an inevitably important situation in film-making...

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:04.580
...basically a performance that symmetrically portrays...

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:07.090
...the identity of one sukeban, to put it one way or another!

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:09.860
To create agitation is the true meaning of being an independent film-maker!

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:12.880
In other words, a form of trade-conflict is what's on the table...

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:18.210
You'd better know where we can peep from!

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:20.260
The Girls' Locker Room is my garden!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:30.490
Kasuga!

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:42.180
I can't believe... that I used my Power just like that!

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:50.540
K...Kasuga just...

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:53.340
