00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:07.980
Oh, no? Then... it's Super Magic!

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:08.400
N...No?

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:11.130
Wh...What're you talking about?!
N...No?

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:11.220
N...No?

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:14.280
That's crazy! How could I just "vanish?"

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:22.370
So that's it! Kasuga Kyosuke, so that's what you are!

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:23.970
Wh...What're you talking about?!

00:06:23.970 --> 00:06:27.510
Don't play dumb with us, man!
Eh... Mr. ESPer!

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:33.980
