deceived us all this time!

00:06:33.980 --> 00:06:37.170
The vanishing act you just did...
It's called "teleportation," right?

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:38.600
I saw it on TV last night.

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:43.060
Me too! The "ESPer Mimi" show, right?
I saw it on TV last night.

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:43.150
I saw it on TV last night.

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:44.110
You idiot! Huh?! I was talking about "My Place Is Whimsical Road!"

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:47.130
You idiot! Huh?! I was talking about "My Place Is Whimsical Road!"
Puns: "Orenchi" = "my place." "Dooro" = "road."

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:50.570
