Hollywood, here we come!

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:34.790
The Cannes Grand Prix to boot!

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:37.420
French babes á la carte!
The Cannes Grand Prix to boot!

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:37.540
The Cannes Grand Prix to boot!

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:38.160
Yeah! We did it!

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:40.130
Ta-da! Ta-da!
Yeah! We did it!

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:40.220
Yeah! We did it!

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:45.260
Would you knock it off?!
Y...You guys were just seeing things!

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:47.180
How could I possibly just vanish?!

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:50.960
