00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:55.380
I...I haven't got it in me to...

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:58.430
You liar. I know you've got it in you...

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:03.830
We know you've got... paranormal powers!

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:08.040
I don't have anything like... th...

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:12.720
Rather stubborn, don'tcha think?

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:13.550
Yeah.
Rather stubborn, don'tcha think?

