Ms. Ayukawa knew that already!
Huh?

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:20.090
Of course she did.
Ms. Ayukawa knew that already!

00:16:20.090 --> 00:16:20.220
Of course she did.

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:20.790
She knew that, you blithering idiot!
Of course she did.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:21.990
Y...Yeah...
She knew that, you blithering idiot!

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:22.130
Y...Yeah...

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:22.260
Hatta, you blithering idiot!
Y...Yeah...

00:16:22.260 --> 00:16:24.290
