00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:06.410
"Sukeban Officer," Scene 48... The Final Confrontation!

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:09.000
Here's a take... Start!

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:10.940
You got some nerve, girl!

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:13.500
Come to get your butt kicked?
You got some nerve, girl!

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:17.970
W... Whatcha laughin' about?!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:21.930
I've got more friends than just these...

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:23.420
Just look!

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:25.840
