underestimated us, dimwits!

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:29.900
I'm Asayami Sachi
of Koryo Police School, 3-B!

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:31.940
A.k.a...

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:33.950
The Sukeban Officer!

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:36.450
