00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:42.320
You bitches are busted but good!

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:45.300
Oh! Oh! I'm falling!

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:47.280
What?! Hikaru!

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:50.000
Hikaru!

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:53.510
