00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:56.920
Hikaru!

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:58.790
Whoa! Whoa!
Hikaru!

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:00.060
YES!

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:00.760
Kasuga!
YES!

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:02.790
Hikaru!
Kasuga!

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:10.320
