when the two of us are using the Power?!

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:11.950
'Cause, it's such a long distance from home!

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:13.140
"From home?!"

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:16.720
That's a MATTRESS! I was talking about
a MAT from the gym!

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:22.960
Oh! I know!

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:24.800
I'll be right there!

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:28.020
You're gonna fall! What'cha doing, Kasuga?!

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:30.530
Do your teleportation thing now!

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:33.710
I know! I don't have to use the Power to teleport...

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:44.560
Wh...Wh...Wh... Whatta... Whatta?!

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:53.300
T... This can't be!

00:19:53.300 --> 00:19:54.110
Kasuga!
T... This can't be!

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:56.140
Oniichan!
Kasuga!

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:01.800
Ayukawa...

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:05.570
YES!

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:07.280
Oh? Huh?!

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:09.970
Huh?!

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:12.020
He's dunnit...

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:15.040
K...Kasuga, are you all right?!

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:17.800
Now it looks like...

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:22.130
...I can't stay in this town anymore...

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:26.070
2nd Koryo School Video Contest Entry
"Sukeban Officer - Part 1"
(Formerly "Mini-Patrol-Unit Saga")
A Youth with Paranormal Powers!

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:30.040
Are you ready?! Here's the Real McCoy!
No special effects!

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:33.380
Gee, what could be
taking Darling so long, huh?

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:37.290
And, now...

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:39.890
...here's the grand masterpiece that captured the glorious debut...

00:20:39.890 --> 00:20:42.940
...of a young man with paranormal powers!
Let us begin!

00:20:57.870 --> 00:20:58.890
Say, Kurumi?

00:20:58.890 --> 00:21:00.620
Aren't Kyosuke and Manami back yet?

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:01.410
I dunno.

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:04.240
They did say they'll be coming home after the video contest ends.

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:07.760
How pathetic can they be?!

00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:10.730
Watching video evidence that he's got paranormal powers...

00:21:10.730 --> 00:21:12.750
Just what can he be thinking?!

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:17.350
Ayukawa...

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:18.480
Huh?
Ayukawa...

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:21.770
Hey, Kasuga, have you got
any idea what they're up to?

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:24.890
Changing the subtitle without letting us know and all!

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:27.410
Ayukawa...

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:30.150
I... I need to...

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:31.150
I've got to tell her!

00:21:31.150 --> 00:21:33.480
I've gotta tell her like a man, tell her myself,
before she finds out...

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:35.370
...that I have paranormal powers!

00:21:36.470 --> 00:21:37.710
What's the matter?

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:40.440
You shouldn't have
underestimated us, dimwits!
What's the matter?

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:43.690
A...Ayukawa... I...

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:46.910
