Hey! What the heck is this?!

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:14.230
Hey! What the heck is this?!

00:22:14.230 --> 00:22:16.210
Saved... I'm saved!

00:22:16.210 --> 00:22:18.010
Geez, what's with this?!
Saved... I'm saved!

00:22:18.010 --> 00:22:18.100
Saved... I'm saved!

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:19.430
Manami! Did you...

00:22:19.430 --> 00:22:22.210
