00:24:49.680 --> 00:24:54.020
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:54.020 --> 00:24:58.320
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.320 --> 00:25:02.660
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.660 --> 00:25:07.480
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:13.090 --> 00:25:15.040
Balance compassion
and obligations on a scale...

00:25:15.040 --> 00:25:17.270
